4b:["$","p","p-36",{"children":["这什么意思呢？通过文件名称我们其实就可以猜到了，",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"lockrank_off.go"}]," 是提供了无锁级别的锁，而 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"lockrank_on.go"}]," 是提供了有锁级别的锁。至于应该采用哪一个，是通过 go build 中的 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"goexperiment.staticlockranking"}]," 参数来控制的。"]}]
